---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 dark:text-gray-200">The Results: Measurable Impact</h2>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-4">
    <div class="purple-gradient rounded-lg p-6 text-center">
      <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2">78.4%</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">Bug Reduction</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">vs. previous quarter</div>
    </div>
    <div class="blue-gradient rounded-lg p-6 text-center">
      <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">44%</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">Faster Delivery</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">reduced review cycles</div>
    </div>
    <div class="green-gradient rounded-lg p-6 text-center">
      <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-2">89%</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">WCAG Compliance</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Level AA achieved</div>
    </div>
    <div class="orange-gradient rounded-lg p-6 text-center">
      <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-orange-600 mb-2">3.7x</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">ROI</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">$2.2M annual value</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="silver-gradient rounded-lg p-6 not-prose">
    <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 text-lg dark:text-gray-200">How the Three Stages Work Together</h3>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-6 h-6 bg-purple-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <strong>IDE catches 87% of issues instantly</strong> while developers code, with immediate AI-powered guidance from the MCP Server.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Git Hooks catch 96% of remaining issues</strong> before code reaches the remote repository, with two-stage progressive validation.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-6 h-6 bg-green-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <strong>CI/CD catches the final 4%</strong> with comprehensive testing, security scanning, and performance validation before deployment.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-lg text-sm dark:bg-black/40 dark:border-gray-600/30">
      <strong>The Result:</strong> 99% of issues are caught before code review, reducing reviewer burden by 53% and enabling 44% faster delivery with 78.4% fewer bugs.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 text-center">
    <a href="/impact-metrics" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-700 font-medium">
      Deeper Look: Impact & Metrics
      <Icon name="line-md:arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4" />
    </a>
  </div>
